{"unit_id":"nineberg__dsh-plugin-island#card-zh","repo":"nineberg/dsh-plugin-island","commit":"9e3d832379742cc3c283403d40d73808a2a02fab","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness 插件灵动岛是面向 Web GUI 的插件面板启动器。它把侧栏面板图标收纳为灵动岛上的启动芯片，点击即可重新打开面板，也可通过加号菜单添加、从芯片移除或拖动调整顺序。最多显示五个芯片，其余可在列表弹层中访问；整座灵动岛可在屏幕上拖动。面板清单会随侧栏插槽变化更新，芯片与位置保存在浏览器本地，适合希望快速切换常用面板的 Harness 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:180-211","client.js:246-250","client.js:316-365","client.js:497-557"]}
{"unit_id":"nineberg__dsh-plugin-island#card-en","repo":"nineberg/dsh-plugin-island","commit":"9e3d832379742cc3c283403d40d73808a2a02fab","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DeepSeek Harness Plugin Island is a Web GUI panel launcher. Drag sidebar icons into the island, then click chips to reopen panels. Add, remove, or reorder chips; five show directly, with overflow in a menu. Move the island freely. Panels and position persist in browser storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:180-211","client.js:246-250","client.js:316-365","client.js:497-557"]}
